# Page & layout changes

- Run `npm run test:e2e` after editing routes, nav, or page shells.
- SEO: use existing `<Seo />` component with `path` matching the route.
- Lazy-loaded routes live in `src/App.tsx` — keep chunk names stable when possible.
- Resume page: preserve Interactive/PDF toggle (`button.toggle-option`) and `.resume-container`.
